            <p>
                Need an older Kantu version? => New: Get it from the <a href="/kantu/web-automation/chrome/archive">Kantu Extension Archive</a>. We
                <a href="https://a9t9.us11.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=ce17e59f5b68a2fd3542801fd&id=e9fe3bc413">beta test</a>
                each production release, but with the amazing variety of use cases for Kantu there is always a chance that a rare regression bug escaped our QA tests.
                For this reason we keep an <a href="/kantu/web-automation/chrome/archive">archive of older Kantu versions</a> so that you can temporarily downgrade
                and  are quickly up and running again. But please don't forget to report the issue to us so that we can fix it.
            </p>


            <h2 id="285">What's new with V2.8.5, released April 30, 2018</h2>

            <p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        - Fixed: <a href="/kantu/docs/webextensions/selenium-ide/sendkeys-type">TYPE</a> command regression bug (introduced by our new support for "blur" events)
                    </li>

                </ul>
            </p>


            <h2 id="282">What's new with V2.8.2, released April 29, 2018</h2>

            <p>This release adds five new commands. The new <a href="/kantu/docs/webextensions/selenium-ide/sourceExtract-sourceSearch">sourceExtract</a> and 
            <a href="/kantu/docs/webextensions/selenium-ide/sourceExtract-sourceSearch">sourceSearch</a> commands 
            allow you inspect and scrape from <span class="hired">page HTML source code</span>.</p>
  


            <p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        - Added: <a href="/kantu/docs/webextensions/selenium-ide/sourceExtract-sourceSearch">sourceSearch</a> searches for strings
                        in the page source code and returns the number of matches (or 0 if no match is found). Full support for regular expressions, including groups.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        - Added: <a href="/kantu/docs/webextensions/selenium-ide/sourceExtract-sourceSearch">sourceExtract</a> extract strings 
                        from the page source code. Full support for regular expressions, including groups. Returns #nomatchfound if no match is found.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        - Added: <a href="/kantu/docs/webextensions/selenium-ide#onerror">onError</a> | #Restart  - restarts the macro if an error occurred. Useful for stress testing and endless loops.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        - Added: <a href="/kantu/docs/webextensions/selenium-ide#onerror">onError</a> | #goto | label  - jumps to "label" if an error happened.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        - Changed: Kantu brings the Chrome Window now in the foreground. If you don't like this: 
                          We will have a switch to control this behavior soon. We made "Bring to foreground" the default as it works well with
                      <a href="/kantu/docs/webextensions#bookmarks">bookmarks</a>.  
                          </li>
                    <li>
                        - Added: <a href="/kantu/docs/webextensions/selenium-ide/waitforvisible">WaitForVisible</a> 
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        - Added: <a href="/kantu/docs/webextensions/selenium-ide/echo">echo | text | #shownotification</a> triggers a notification dialog ;-)
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        -  Fixed: Smaller bugs and tweaks
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </p>

